{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026yHoPugUAkh1794999885.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中環皇后像廣場花園化身歐陸風格火車站，更有歷年最高、22米的聖誕樹。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_LIVE.WINTERFEST 1830.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026IwgQWM4KON1795000033.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>每晚七時至十一時，每半小時亦有光影匯演，投映在終審法院等附近九座標誌性建築的外牆。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_LIVE.WINTERFEST 1830_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ax2QjgfUjN1795000098.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T12:24:19.173534+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":76,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T11:04:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T13:17:21.314546+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T12:17:21.541334+00:00","content_hash":"d8e3fe167f777fe357d5648efcb4b72cc930446e4f37f29f2162ee97efcd3e37","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T12:24:19.173534+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}